    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekya mbere na mbere nimbatagiliza mushome enshara mutakilire abantu bona, mubashabire mara mubasiimire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mushabire abakama n'abatwazi bona tubone oburora bw'emilembe, obw'obuchulezi, oburora obwolekeire ahali Ruhanga, mara tube bantu abasaine kukunirwa omuli byona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekigambo eki kirungi, mara nikishemelera Ruhanga Omurokozi waitu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "agonza abantu bona kabarokoka mara bakamanya amazima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ruhanga ab'omoi wenkai, n'omubaka wa Ruhanga n'abantu ab'omoi, mara omubaka ogwo aba Yesu Kirisito, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ayayeyangire oburorabwe kuchungura abantu bona. Ebyo bikamanyikira omu bukiro bwabyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inye nkatewaho kuba murangi mara ntumwa (ningamba amazima mara tindikubeiya), mba mwegesa w'Abanyamahanga, mbarangire okwikiliza n'amazima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'inyenda buli hantu abashaija babe nibo bata nibashoma enshara, baimukize emikono nyakatetere, abashaija enzira biniga na mpaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwakwo n'abakazi belengye okwo kisaine, batashuka ishoke anga kulitekamu zahabu anga mabare ga iguzi anga kujwara emyendo ey'eiguzi lingi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babe b'ebikorwa birungi nk'okwo abakazi abain'edini balikuragirwa kuba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukazi amanye kugira omuhuliro nyantayuga obuzira kukeleekeza rulimi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tindikujubura mukazi kuba niwe ayegesa mushaija handiki kumutungama aha mutwe. Naragirwa kwesiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha rw'okuba Adamu niwe yabumbirwe mbere, Eva yaruga nyuma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adamu tiyabeihyabeihirwe; omukazi niwe yabeihyabeihirwe akafakara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai omukazi alirokorwa okuzara abana, k'aliguma omu kwesiga n'omu ngonzi akaikara ali mutakatifu mara akaguma ayebaliire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.2.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
